   ['ا / ع : alif is plain; ain is squeezed from the middle of the throat.','ه / ح : light h from deep in the throat vs breathy ḥ from mid-throat.','ك / ق : light k vs heavy q from the very back of the tongue.','س / ص , ت / ط , د / ض , ذ / ز / ظ : the second of each is heavy.','ث / س : tha uses the tongue tip between the teeth.'],
